# Frontend git workflow (Bedrock monorepo)

`web/frontend` is a **normal directory** in this Bedrock repo (not a submodule). Commit React/Vite source and published SPA files from the repo root.

## Frontend / SPA changes

```bash
cd web/frontend
npm run build          # vite build + publish dist → index.html / assets/
cd ../..               # repo root
git add web/frontend
git commit -m "Describe the frontend change"
```

- Do **not** commit `web/frontend/dist/` or `node_modules/` (gitignored).
- Do commit published `web/frontend/index.html` and hashed bundles under `web/frontend/assets/` after a production build so `git pull` on the server updates `public_html/frontend/`.
- Never wipe `assets/fonts/` or `assets/image/` when publishing.

## PHP / Bedrock-only changes

Commit plugin/config/docs as usual; no separate frontend remote or submodule pointer update.
